Arc News Workers is a modified version of the Arc news application, translated
to TypeScript for Cloudflare Workers. It is distributed under Artistic-2.0.

Original software: copyright (c) Paul Graham and Robert Morris.
Source: https://github.com/wting/hackernews
Original news.arc blob: d21f6676ee8921a0dad57aa86c2179197c15d4bd
An unmodified reference copy is included in upstream/news.arc.

This modified version was created on 2026-11-16. It replaces the Arc/Scheme
runtime, filesystem persistence, HTTP server, login implementation, and closure
URLs with TypeScript, D1, Web Crypto, and explicit HTTP handlers. It does not
claim compatibility with every Arc feature or with the current Hacker News
production service. It uses a different name to distinguish it from the
Standard Version. See README.md for supported behavior and differences.
